          <li>Contributed to ETL/ELT workflow automation across AWS (Lambda, EMR, S3, Redshift, Glue) and PostgreSQL, leveraging <strong>PySpark and Redshift Spectrum to process terabyte-scale data</strong>, supporting pipelines driving a 10% CPA drop and 12% performance lift across client pipelines.</li>
