          <li>Developed and delivered responsible AI and digital literacy curricula on AI bias, cultural representation, privacy, hallucinations, prompt design, phishing detection, and secure technology use; coached learners through technical projects while collaborating with curriculum and instructional leadership to strengthen classroom engagement, learner confidence, and skill.</li>
